Preliminary API Concepts for Single Entry Point (subject to change) - v 0.1

GET - USED TO RETRIEVE DATA FROM THE SERVER

GET /digital-twins/endpoints
Retrieve a list of registered external RDF endpoints available for federated querying.

GET /metadata/endpoints
List available metadata repositories (internal and external).

GET /digital-twins/{id}/contributors
Retrieve a list of users or institutions that contributed to a specific Digital Twin.

GET /digital-twins/{id}/history
Retrieve the version history of a Digital Twin, including changes to metadata, structure, or linked media.

GET /digital-twins/{id}/usage
Show how often a Digital Twin has been accessed, used in tools, or cited.






